WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.330
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:11.350
Last time: symmetry and patterns

3
00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:18.210
Chapter 4 · Angles and Turns

4
00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:24.360
Turn like a coding robot!

5
00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:34.430
Meet Arjun at morning assembly

6
00:00:34.430 --> 00:00:39.330
"Right turn!"

7
00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:45.550
"About turn!" Now he faces the other way

8
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:52.820
Did Arjun walk anywhere? Think!

9
00:00:52.820 --> 00:01:02.360
Same spot! Only the way he faces changed

10
00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:06.780
Turn: change the way you face, stay on the spot

11
00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:16.570
How much you turn = an angle, in degrees (°)

12
00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:26.360
All the way round = full turn = 360°

13
00:01:26.360 --> 00:01:36.560
Quarter turn: a square corner

14
00:01:36.560 --> 00:01:43.260
Quarter turn = 90°

15
00:01:43.260 --> 00:01:55.370
Square corners everywhere: 90°

16
00:01:55.370 --> 00:02:04.250
Clock: 12 → 3 is a quarter turn (90°)

17
00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:13.540
2 quarter turns = 90° + 90° = 180°

18
00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:23.050
Half turn: face the opposite way · 12 → 6

19
00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:33.870
3 quarter turns = 270° · 12 → 9

20
00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:47.180
4 quarter turns = 360° = full turn!

21
00:02:47.180 --> 00:03:01.550
Four directions: North, East, South, West

22
00:03:01.550 --> 00:03:12.460
Right turn = clockwise: N → E → S → W

23
00:03:12.460 --> 00:03:22.670
Left turn = anticlockwise: N → W → S → E

24
00:03:22.670 --> 00:03:31.340
Never Eat Soggy Wheat → N, E, S, W

25
00:03:31.340 --> 00:03:36.960
Game time! Arjun faces north

26
00:03:36.960 --> 00:03:43.010
Facing north. 1 quarter turn right → ?

27
00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:47.500
East! Right is clockwise

28
00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:57.160
Facing east. 1 quarter turn left → ?

29
00:03:57.160 --> 00:04:02.970
North! Left is anticlockwise

30
00:04:02.970 --> 00:04:11.930
Facing north. 3 quarter turns right → ?

31
00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:23.330
West! N → E → S → W is 270°

32
00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:35.160
"Turn right 90° is anticlockwise." True?

33
00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:43.820
False! Right turn = clockwise

34
00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:51.910
Coding: "turn right 90"

35
00:04:51.910 --> 00:05:00.610
It spins on the spot. No walking!

36
00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:08.690
turn right 90 × 4 = a full turn

37
00:05:08.690 --> 00:05:15.070
Next chapter: draw shapes with turns!

38
00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:18.770
Your turn: practice check

39
00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:30.480
Face north. 2 quarter turns right. Which way?

40
00:05:30.480 --> 00:05:42.470
South! N → E → S is a half turn

41
00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:52.970
90° quarter · 180° half · 360° full

42
00:05:52.970 --> 00:05:55.700
4 quarter turns bring you back

43
00:05:55.700 --> 00:06:01.060
Right turn = clockwise: N → E → S → W

44
00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:04.630
A turn changes where you face

45
00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:09.700
Chapter 4 done!

46
00:06:09.700 --> 00:06:16.500
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
